event: thinking
data: {"id": "ea339e81f65948ae-thinking-parallel_evidence-931", "run_id": "ea339e81f65948ae", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 采集到的关键事实\n\n1.  **Pod 状态与生命周期**：\n    *   **Phase**: `Pending` (与 Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending` 和 `waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` 一致)。\n    *   **Node**: 已调度至 `node2`。\n    *   **容器**: `app` (镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)，`ready=False`，`restarts=0`。\n\n2.  **异常事件 (Events)**：\n    *   **NoNetworkFound** (Warning): 持续出现。\n    *   **FailedCreatePodSandBox** (Warning): 持续出现。\n    *   **根因消息**: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788780634114, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "ea339e81f65948ae-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "ea339e81f65948ae", "seq": 932, "ts_ms": 1788780641529, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 48.926, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/ea339e81f65948ae-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "2a48bd467d3ac9730d732e07f2ead289e7491ce3ee87f55a3d4b72792cf9641d", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "90921de4f40ad456b772755ec43932d46056ca744ade4c3d2d153ca7c397b415"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "ea339e81f65948ae-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "ea339e81f65948ae", "seq": 933, "ts_ms": 1788780641530, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "ea339e81f65948ae-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "ea339e81f65948ae", "seq": 934, "ts_ms": 1788780652440, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.91, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1943, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container 'app' waiting_reason: `ContainerCreating` [fact-30053d5ca3f6] | 描述 Pod 卡滞的最终状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | multus | Repeated warnings: `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` [fact-001b172c1350, fact-0793c00e34d9, 共46条] | 核心错误事件：Multus 尝试查找 Pod 引用的 `unavailable-network` 时失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `rpc error... Multus... failed getting the delegate: ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)` [fact-1add590034a8, fact-28702b73e8c4, 共8次] | 辅助错误事件：底层容器运行时因网络插件报错而放弃创建沙箱 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = `1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`, labels: `container: app`, samples: 1) [fact-7e81a475f598] | 验证容器确实处于等待状态，仅单点样本确认 |\n\n证据说明：\nKubernetes State 与 Metric 确认了容器因网络配置缺失而卡滞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。多组 `K8s Event` 直接指出了根本原因：Multus 插件试图处理 Pod 的 CNI 网络需求时，发现 Pod 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下引用的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源 `unavailable-network` 根本不存在（`not found`），导致 kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 的 annotation 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'\n  →\nMultus CNI 插件无法在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中找到该网络定义资源\n  →\nPod Sandbox 创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) 并持续返回 NoNetworkFound 警告\n  →\n容器 app 卡滞于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的配置中引用了一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义（`NetworkAttachmentDefinition`），但该资源在目标命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中并不存在。这一配置错误导致 Multus CNI 插件无法分配网络，引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态（证据：[fact-001b172c1350], [fact-1add590034a8]）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container 'app' waiting_reason: `ContainerCreating` [fact-30053d5ca3f6] | 描述 Pod 卡滞的最终状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | multus | Repeated warnings: `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` [fact-001b172c1350, fact-0793c00e34d9, 共46条] | 核心错误事件：Multus 尝试查找 Pod 引用的 `unavailable-network` 时失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `rpc error... Multus... failed getting the delegate: ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)` [fact-1add590034a8, fact-28702b73e8c4, 共8次] | 辅助错误事件：底层容器运行时因网络插件报错而放弃创建沙箱 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = `1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`, labels: `container: app`, samples: 1) [fact-7e81a475f598] | 验证容器确实处于等待状态，仅单点样本确认 |\n\n证据说明：\nKubernetes State 与 Metric 确认了容器因网络配置缺失而卡滞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。多组 `K8s Event` 直接指出了根本原因：Multus 插件试图处理 Pod 的 CNI 网络需求时，发现 Pod 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下引用的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源 `unavailable-network` 根本不存在（`not found`），导致 kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 的 annotation 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'\n  →\nMultus CNI 插件无法在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中找到该网络定义资源\n  →\nPod Sandbox 创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) 并持续返回 NoNetworkFound 警告\n  →\n容器 app 卡滞于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的配置中引用了一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义（`NetworkAttachmentDefinition`），但该资源在目标命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中并不存在。这一配置错误导致 Multus CNI 插件无法分配网络，引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态（证据：[fact-001b172c1350], [fact-1add590034a8]）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "ea339e81f65948ae-final", "run_id": "ea339e81f65948ae", "seq": 936, "ts_ms": 1788780652453, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container 'app' waiting_reason: `ContainerCreating` [fact-30053d5ca3f6] | 描述 Pod 卡滞的最终状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | multus | Repeated warnings: `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` [fact-001b172c1350, fact-0793c00e34d9, 共46条] | 核心错误事件：Multus 尝试查找 Pod 引用的 `unavailable-network` 时失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `rpc error... Multus... failed getting the delegate: ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)` [fact-1add590034a8, fact-28702b73e8c4, 共8次] | 辅助错误事件：底层容器运行时因网络插件报错而放弃创建沙箱 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = `1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`, labels: `container: app`, samples: 1) [fact-7e81a475f598] | 验证容器确实处于等待状态，仅单点样本确认 |\n\n证据说明：\nKubernetes State 与 Metric 确认了容器因网络配置缺失而卡滞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。多组 `K8s Event` 直接指出了根本原因：Multus 插件试图处理 Pod 的 CNI 网络需求时，发现 Pod 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下引用的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源 `unavailable-network` 根本不存在（`not found`），导致 kubelet 无法创建 Pod Sandbox。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 的 annotation 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'\n  →\nMultus CNI 插件无法在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中找到该网络定义资源\n  →\nPod Sandbox 创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) 并持续返回 NoNetworkFound 警告\n  →\n容器 app 卡滞于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的配置中引用了一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义（`NetworkAttachmentDefinition`），但该资源在目标命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中并不存在。这一配置错误导致 Multus CNI 插件无法分配网络，引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态（证据：[fact-001b172c1350], [fact-1add590034a8]）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 48.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 48.9s (Evidence 41.6s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 75.848, "metrics": {"run_id": "ea339e81f65948ae", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 75.85497188568115, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"to